OL,5,G0130 Autopsy
OL,6,     FThe world learned on June 8, 2018,
OL,7,     Fthat Anthony Bourdain had died by
OL,8,     Fsuicide. This episode examines the
OL,9,     Fbeloved chef, travel writer and
OL,10,     Fdocumentarian's final days. (Ep23)
OL,11,G0225 Autopsy
OL,12,     FOn May 14, 1998, the world was
OL,13,     Fsaddened by news that the singer
OL,14,     Fand actor Frank Sinatra had died.
OL,15,     FAutopsy reports reveal the cause
OL,16,     Fbehind the death of this icon of
OL,17,     Fthe music world. (Ep24)
